<title>LITHUANIA: PPI DOWN MO/MO IN MARCH, RISES YR/YR.</title>
<headline>PPI DOWN MO/MO IN MARCH, RISES YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The producer price index fell 0.7 percent in March versus February but rose by 8.3 percent versus March 1996,the statistics department said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The statistics department also said the producer price index for the first quarter of 1997 increased by 9.9 percent compared to the same period last year.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom, +370 2 22 35 17</p>
